--- !u!114 &214126508826214741
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7195985103588832546}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '--- All Allies ---

    - Attack: Normal attacks the enemy

    - Defend:
    Increases Defense by 50% for 1 turn


    --- Bookwyrm ---

    - PASSIVE: Normal
    attacks restore 15% max mana

    - Lore Dump: Apply [10% attack buff, 10% defense
    buff, 10% crit rate buff, haste] for 3 turns to all allies

    - Demonization:
    Lowers an enemy''s Defense by [20%] for [2 turns].

    - Frame Manipulation:
    Speed up an ally to grant them a turn

    - Mouse Trap: Make an enemy Blind
    for [2 turns].


    --- Karaage ---

    - PASSIVE: After landing 10 hits, fast
    forward their turn progress

    - Yabai!: Hits an enemy 4 times

    - Wing
    Clipper: Hits an enemy once for high damage and slows them for 1 turn

    -
    Feather Stich: Heals an ally for 25% of their max hp

    - Clip Farm: Hits an
    enemy 1-8 (random) times


    --- John Dreamblade ---

    - PASSIVE: Starts
    the battle with Blurry for 2 turns

    - All-Kill: Deals damage to every enemy

    -
    Bias Wrecker: Deals high damage to one enemy

    - Aegyo: Grants all allies
    a 3 durability shield

    - Vacant Void: Removes 2 random buffs from an enemy


    ---
    Apollo / Phoebe ---

    - PASSIVE:  Skills deal 25% more damage

    - World
    Cutting Slash: Deals high damage to all target, costs 15% of max health (can
    cast if it will kill the character, in which the skill will not do damage)

    -
    Riposte: Grants themselves a 2 durability shield

    - Instigation: Grants themselves
    a 75% defense increas for 2 turns

    - Blackout: Deals high damage to all enemies


    ---
    ENEMY BEHAVIOR ---

    - Minion (Support): Randomly casts supportive spells
    that heal and/or shield the enemies

    - The Mimic: At the start of the fight
    and every 2 turns, copy a random ally (the old copied ally becomes uncopied).
    When an ally is copied, the boss is able to use any of the ally''s skills, and
    the ally is Silenced while copied. The target for the boss''s copied skills will
    be a random ally.


    --- TERMINOLOGY ---

    - Accuracy: Chance for an attack
    or skill to land

    - Attack: Stat used to calculate normal attack damage

    -
    Blind: Reduce accuracy by 50%

    - Blurry: Increase evasion by 50%

    - Crit
    Chance: Stat used to determine if an attack/skill critically strikes

    - Crit
    Damage: Stat used to determine the amount of extra dmg on critical strikes

    -
    Defense: Stat used to mitigate a portion of damage received from attacks and
    skills

    - Evasion: Chance to dodge an incoming attack or skill

    - Haste:
    Increase speed by 30%

    - Mana: Stat used as a resource needed for casting
    skills

    - Shield: Prevents an instance of damage (regardless of the amount),
    each instance blocked costs 1 durability

    - Silence: Prevents a character
    from using a skill

    - Slow: Decrease speed by 30%

    - Speed: Stat used
    to determine turn order, higher speeds means more frequent turns

    - Stun:
    Skips a character''s turn


'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a35d5539884a924285d22d0d9667798, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2969928266192370010, guid: 7a35d5539884a924285d22d0d9667798, type: 2}
